{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2022-10-25 14:47:00', 'title': 'TRUIST DECLARES COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. , OCT. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TRUIST FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NYSE: TFC) DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.52 PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE ON DEC. 1, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOV. 10, 2022.'}